                          <rules>
                            <rule name="Atonement Through Honour" id="70ce-6296-e64f-31b5" hidden="false">
                              <description>A model with this special rule doubles its attacks in the assault phase if it is locked in combat with an IC, a MC or a Vehicle, or if the combat it is in contains more enemy models than friendly ones (count all models locked in the combat, not just the ones engaged with this model).</description>
