          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When Krak Grenades are used in assaults against vehicles, gun emplacements or Monstrous Creatures, Krak grenades have the following profile:
S6 AP4 Melee 1

