          <rules>
            <rule name="War Hymns" id="4a664548-6273-b33b-5879-0b26491e272d" hidden="false" page="0">
              <description>Take Leadership test at the beginning of each Fight sub-phase when locked in close combat.  If successful, choose a hymn:
* The Emperor Protects - Re-roll all failed armor and invulnerable saves until the end of the phase.
* The Emperor&apos;s Strength - This model has the Smash rule (BRB 2014 p171) until the end of the phase.
* The Righteousness of the Emperor - re-roll failed rolls To Wound until the end of the phase.</description>
            </rule>
